WEBVTT

00:13.729 --> 00:14.980
Akine Atagawa.

00:16.481 --> 00:17.315
Please.

00:18.900 --> 00:20.402
I would like us to be friends.

00:21.903 --> 00:22.946
Manatsu Atagawa's...

00:24.114 --> 00:25.282
little sister?

01:57.916 --> 02:01.670
Inversion

02:02.671 --> 02:03.713
Manatsu Atagawa!

02:04.256 --> 02:05.757
I've played ball for years.

02:05.841 --> 02:07.467
It's nice to meet all of you.

02:08.260 --> 02:09.761
- Welcome to the club.
- Nice to meet you.

02:09.845 --> 02:12.639
- How are ya doing!
- During my first year of junior high

02:13.140 --> 02:15.308
Sachi, my neighbor at the time invited me

02:15.809 --> 02:17.519
to join the basketball team.

02:17.602 --> 02:18.687
Koyuki!

02:19.437 --> 02:20.814
I'm so glad you signed up!

02:21.398 --> 02:22.983
Sorry, I'm no Miki, but-

02:23.066 --> 02:25.777
Hey, I'm happy you joined us even if Miki
couldn't.

02:26.403 --> 02:27.362
Volleyball CHOP!

02:27.445 --> 02:28.363
*MIKI JOINED THE VOLLEYBALL CLUB

02:28.446 --> 02:31.533
- Is this your friend, Sachi?
- I think we'll make a good team.

02:31.616 --> 02:33.952
- It's nice to meet you all.
- Nice to meet you!

02:34.035 --> 02:36.204
- Glad to have you.
- The upperclassmen were so nice to me.

02:36.288 --> 02:37.122
GRADE 3 CLASS 1

02:37.205 --> 02:38.039
Here you go.

02:38.123 --> 02:40.709
The second and third years'll practice on
the court.

02:40.792 --> 02:43.378
The first years will practice something
else today.

02:43.461 --> 02:44.296
Okay.

02:44.880 --> 02:47.257
It was reassuring to have someone I knew
there.

02:47.799 --> 02:48.884
Tell all the others!

02:51.845 --> 02:52.679
Hey Koyuki.

02:53.638 --> 02:54.639
Come again, okay?

02:56.600 --> 02:58.018
She's so cuuuute!

02:58.101 --> 02:59.019
Leave her alone!

02:59.519 --> 03:01.271
That's why I didn't notice it sooner.

03:01.354 --> 03:02.480
You guys are so lame.

03:02.564 --> 03:04.858
- Why're we lame?
- She clearly didn't like it.

03:04.941 --> 03:06.193
What was all that?

03:06.818 --> 03:07.694
GIRLS' BASKETBALL CLUB

03:07.777 --> 03:09.654
The first years will be practicing
outside today.

03:09.738 --> 03:10.572
Hm?

03:10.655 --> 03:13.033
Captain gave me this practice program to
follow.

03:13.116 --> 03:14.117
What is this?

03:14.201 --> 03:15.118
Huh?

03:15.202 --> 03:16.036
ATAGAWA

03:16.119 --> 03:18.121
Why're you acting like you're in charge?

03:19.581 --> 03:22.709
At first, I just thought the issue was
that she didn't like being told

03:22.792 --> 03:23.627
what to do.

03:24.836 --> 03:25.670
But

03:25.754 --> 03:26.588
CHATTER CHATTER

03:26.671 --> 03:28.673
I wonder if we can make her grow any
taller.

03:28.757 --> 03:30.342
- Hey, you're just stretching her neck.
- Mm?

03:30.425 --> 03:33.220
- Hey every little bit helps in basketball,
- I realized she didn't like me

03:33.303 --> 03:34.137
- right?
- because of how close I was to the

03:34.221 --> 03:35.055
upperclassmen.

03:36.681 --> 03:37.515
Hmm

03:38.642 --> 03:41.770
I get from Manatsu's point of view,
my closeness to Sachi looks like I'm

03:41.853 --> 03:42.938
maybe sucking up, but-

03:43.021 --> 03:44.272
CHILDHOOD FRIENDS CLOSE FRIENDS

03:44.356 --> 03:46.233
I'M MORE SKILLED THAN HER RESENTMENT
I'M MORE SKILLED THAN HER RESENTMENT

03:46.316 --> 03:47.150
Huh?

03:48.151 --> 03:48.985
Atagawa!

03:50.195 --> 03:52.697
The captain asked me to come see
her during lunch. Do ya wanna come

03:52.781 --> 03:53.615
with me?

03:54.241 --> 03:55.075
Huh?

03:56.826 --> 03:57.661
Thank you.

03:57.744 --> 04:01.373
I didn't feel comfortable going to the
third-years' classroom on my own.

04:03.375 --> 04:06.169
I don't get it. Why did the captain
make you her go-to?

04:06.253 --> 04:07.837
We already knew each other.

04:08.380 --> 04:11.216
We live close to each other so she
probably just feels comfortable

04:11.299 --> 04:12.133
talking to me.

04:13.260 --> 04:16.513
I think you're the one on the team she
has the highest hopes for.

04:17.472 --> 04:18.306
Yeah?

04:19.182 --> 04:20.058
GRADE 3 CLASS 1

04:20.141 --> 04:22.102
Oh! You came too, Manatsu.

04:22.185 --> 04:23.144
That's awesome.

04:23.228 --> 04:24.187
Huh?

04:24.271 --> 04:25.105
- Hm?
- Huh?

04:25.188 --> 04:27.524
- Is she your friend, Koyuki?
- Leave em alone, would you?

04:27.607 --> 04:28.733
Uh. Yeah. I'm Manatsu.

04:30.735 --> 04:32.153
So apparently we're friends.

04:33.071 --> 04:34.072
I mean it, Koyuki.

04:34.572 --> 04:36.366
You're like, such an awesome friend.

04:36.449 --> 04:38.368
I had the wrong idea about you.

04:38.451 --> 04:39.286
R-Really?

04:39.369 --> 04:40.370
I'M HAPPY TO HEAR THAT, BUT...

04:40.453 --> 04:42.914
- Why the sudden change of heart?
- Oh, by the way.

04:42.998 --> 04:44.249
Just call me Manatsu.

04:45.542 --> 04:47.127
Being on Manatsu's good side

04:47.210 --> 04:49.129
made club activities a lot easier.

04:49.212 --> 04:50.630
Don't worry. Don't worry.

04:51.339 --> 04:53.091
Whenever Manatsu was with me, she got a

04:53.174 --> 04:56.303
- chance to talk to the upperclassmen.
- Hey, what'd ya buy for lunch?

04:56.386 --> 04:58.346
- Oh my gosh hi!
- Our friendship

04:58.430 --> 05:00.849
was based only on benefits, not trust.

05:02.309 --> 05:03.143
So

05:03.226 --> 05:06.980
it wasn't like there was one decisive
event that caused things to break down.

05:07.063 --> 05:10.567
Speaking of people in our grade,
aren't Hotani and Igarashi super cute?

05:10.650 --> 05:11.484
Oh, totally.

05:11.568 --> 05:12.569
- Wait, what?
- Right?

05:13.069 --> 05:13.903
Hey, Koyuki.

05:15.405 --> 05:17.157
What kinda guys're you into?

05:17.240 --> 05:19.451
I can't picture what your type is at all.

05:19.534 --> 05:21.494
Huh? Mm

05:21.578 --> 05:23.413
Someone who doesn't make fun of other
people?

05:23.496 --> 05:26.082
We're just talking about looks here.
Stay on topic.

05:27.042 --> 05:28.543
Huh? Oh, gotcha.

05:29.377 --> 05:30.211
Hmm...

05:30.837 --> 05:32.922
- I'm not sure.
- Okay.

05:33.673 --> 05:36.301
AWKWARD SILENCE

05:36.801 --> 05:37.802
Nice work out there.

05:37.886 --> 05:39.012
- See you later.
- Later.

05:39.095 --> 05:39.971
See ya.

05:43.266 --> 05:45.185
Is it just me or is Koyuki just-

05:45.852 --> 05:47.520
not on the same wavelength as us?

05:48.146 --> 05:49.647
No, I totally feel you.

05:49.731 --> 05:50.857
She's kinda gloomy.

05:50.940 --> 05:51.900
She is!

05:51.983 --> 05:55.111
She talks so freaking slow, and I
kinda got annoyed just then. Could

05:55.195 --> 05:57.447
you tell? I was like, hurry up and answer.

05:57.989 --> 06:00.200
- Of course I could tell.
- Honestly, we hadn't really built

06:00.283 --> 06:01.743
- You were so obvious Manatsu.
- anything to begin with.

06:01.826 --> 06:03.536
Koyuki, you're such a good friend.

06:05.205 --> 06:07.665
Manatsu never liked me for who I was.

06:08.583 --> 06:10.752
She just liked what I could do for her.

06:12.712 --> 06:14.214
You like doing grunt work?

06:14.756 --> 06:17.342
Don't you have anything else going on
in your life?

06:19.135 --> 06:20.303
She's eating all alone.

06:20.804 --> 06:23.264
Ew, her water bottle is so lame,
isn't it?

06:23.890 --> 06:25.058
- Oh, that's insane.
- So

06:25.141 --> 06:27.769
- Right? Are you serious?
- it didn't take much for me to be branded

06:27.852 --> 06:29.854
- as a villain.
- Like what's her problem?

06:31.314 --> 06:33.775
I can't take it anymore. I'm quitting.

06:34.859 --> 06:36.486
I should have quit then and there.

06:36.569 --> 06:39.572
And cut ties with her completely,
gotten her out of my life.

06:39.656 --> 06:40.490
CLUB WITHDRAWAL FORM

06:40.573 --> 06:45.245
So you know... Atagawa's been coming
on to me super strong lately.

06:45.787 --> 06:46.621
Huh?

06:47.372 --> 06:50.875
Although... I'm not into in anyone but
the girl I like... She's barking up

06:50.959 --> 06:52.252
the wrong tree.

06:54.254 --> 06:56.589
Manatsu... likes Igarashi?

06:59.092 --> 07:00.552
Do you get what I'm saying?

07:00.635 --> 07:01.678
Mm?

07:04.222 --> 07:06.266
Let's go out. Koyuki.

07:07.225 --> 07:10.270
Honestly
the very first thing I thought was

07:10.812 --> 07:12.480
Wow, at least he finally said it.

07:13.398 --> 07:15.608
And also "I wish he'd let go of my hand,"

07:16.901 --> 07:20.613
and, "He doesn't seem to think there's
any chance that I'll reject him."

07:20.697 --> 07:22.449
And also, "I don't understand why in the

07:22.532 --> 07:24.075
- world he even started liking me
- Koyuki.

07:24.159 --> 07:25.160
In the first place."

07:25.743 --> 07:27.454
- All at once.
- Koyuki.

07:28.955 --> 07:30.832
Just cutting her out of my life

07:30.915 --> 07:33.001
wouldn't be enough to satiate my anger.

07:34.210 --> 07:36.171
- That's why.
- Sure.

07:36.796 --> 07:40.508
I was more than well aware of all the
red flags my heart was waving at me.

07:41.593 --> 07:42.427
Why not.

07:43.094 --> 07:43.928
But I just

07:44.554 --> 07:46.097
pretended not to notice.

07:47.474 --> 07:48.391
This again.

07:49.434 --> 07:52.020
After I quit the club and started dating
Igarashi

07:52.103 --> 07:54.981
her bullying became way less direct
and obvious.

07:55.482 --> 07:57.484
And more subtle and underhanded.

07:57.567 --> 07:58.526
Yo!

07:58.610 --> 08:02.697
Probably because she didn't want me to go
to Igarashi or the other guys about it.

08:02.780 --> 08:03.823
Besides

08:04.324 --> 08:06.618
I needed proof Manatsu was the one
behind it.

08:06.701 --> 08:08.119
Good morning, Koyun!

08:08.828 --> 08:11.789
I got here with time to spare which
never happens, so...

08:12.457 --> 08:13.291
Huh?

08:16.419 --> 08:18.046
A-ta-ga-waaa!

08:19.297 --> 08:20.131
Get off me!

08:26.930 --> 08:28.139
She shattered the glass!

08:28.640 --> 08:30.975
Oh my gosh Miki! Let's go to the nurse!

08:31.059 --> 08:31.893
Huh?

08:31.976 --> 08:33.811
- Hey- Whoaaaa!
- Whoa, was that blood?

08:33.895 --> 08:35.104
Did they fight?

08:40.109 --> 08:40.944
Are you serious?

08:41.444 --> 08:44.072
You rely on the guys and now Miki
to fight for you?

08:44.781 --> 08:47.659
How are you not ashamed of always
playing the victim and leeching off

08:47.742 --> 08:50.370
everyone around you? It's pathetic.

08:51.788 --> 08:52.622
Because

08:53.414 --> 08:56.084
compared to someone who stoops to
childish bullying

08:56.167 --> 08:57.835
I have nothing to be ashamed of.

08:59.087 --> 09:01.047
I already said I didn't do it, alright?

09:01.631 --> 09:03.216
Who else would do it but you?

09:03.299 --> 09:04.425
Could be anyone.

09:04.926 --> 09:06.844
Everyone passes the shoe lockers.

09:06.928 --> 09:08.012
Idiot.

09:09.931 --> 09:10.890
I never said that.

09:11.766 --> 09:12.600
Huh?

09:12.684 --> 09:14.894
I never said anything about the
shoe lockers.

09:14.978 --> 09:16.688
You were the one who mentioned it.

09:18.147 --> 09:20.358
Hey, over here! This way, guys.

09:20.441 --> 09:21.401
In here.

09:22.777 --> 09:24.779
You did this to yourself.

09:24.862 --> 09:27.073
- Come on.
- Are you nuts?

09:27.699 --> 09:28.533
Come on.

09:29.867 --> 09:30.702
Hey!

09:30.785 --> 09:34.163
First you abandon the club then you get
everyone to take your side.

09:34.747 --> 09:37.917
You're just a sad pathetic loner
who can't do anything herself.

09:38.501 --> 09:39.752
Stay just like that.

09:39.836 --> 09:40.795
Why are you grinning?!

09:40.878 --> 09:41.838
What are you doing?

09:43.506 --> 09:45.258
- Igarashi.
- Hey.

09:45.341 --> 09:47.552
Hey. Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey, hey.

09:48.720 --> 09:51.389
What are you- What are you doing, Atagawa?

09:52.223 --> 09:53.349
Are you okay, Koyuki?

09:56.227 --> 09:57.061
That hurt.

10:02.191 --> 10:03.860
That was sick, Igarashi!

10:03.943 --> 10:04.944
Whoo!

10:05.028 --> 10:05.945
You're the man!

10:06.029 --> 10:07.030
Hmph

10:07.572 --> 10:09.282
You're really lucky, Koyuki.

10:09.365 --> 10:10.617
You can cry so well.

10:10.700 --> 10:12.327
A delicate little flower.

10:12.410 --> 10:13.661
And so cute.

10:14.871 --> 10:17.373
You may have a man fighting your battles
right now.

10:17.457 --> 10:19.167
But don't get carried away.

10:20.418 --> 10:21.252
That's enough!

10:22.128 --> 10:23.504
What'd you just say to her?

10:24.422 --> 10:25.298
Let's go, Koyuki!

10:28.968 --> 10:30.219
Manatsu Atagawa

10:31.804 --> 10:33.348
And her little sister, Akine.

10:34.599 --> 10:35.892
What exactly and how much

10:36.392 --> 10:37.810
does she know about me?

10:40.313 --> 10:42.023
Ugh, I hate this so much!

10:42.106 --> 10:45.485
I'm getting sucked back into the
toxicity of junior high that I hated so

10:45.568 --> 10:46.402
much

10:46.486 --> 10:49.947
Not just that. I hate the person
I was back then. Ugh, I hate it all!

10:55.203 --> 10:57.330
Miki You're on social media now?

10:57.830 --> 11:00.500
Yeah, Miharu and Sora recommended
this app.

11:00.583 --> 11:02.585
MIHARU, SORA FRIENDS FROM JUNIOR HIGH

11:02.669 --> 11:05.672
Oh! Found it!
This is Manatsu's younger sister.

11:06.172 --> 11:07.048
#SISTERS #BESTIES

11:07.131 --> 11:08.174
#Besties.

11:10.051 --> 11:10.885
What's up?

11:11.469 --> 11:13.137
What're you guys doing over here?

11:14.555 --> 11:16.349
Huh? Atagawa?

11:16.974 --> 11:19.352
We're in the same class. We talk all the
time.

11:19.852 --> 11:23.314
Yeah, Akine said she hears a lot about
me from you actually.

11:24.399 --> 11:25.817
So, what have you told her?

11:26.317 --> 11:27.402
Well,

11:27.485 --> 11:30.279
just that we've been close friends
for a long time.

11:30.363 --> 11:34.033
Koyun, if you marry me, you and Miki will
be related. Isn't that so cute?

11:34.117 --> 11:36.285
- You're a genius.
- Yeah sure, whatever.

11:37.036 --> 11:39.163
I also told her you and I might get
married.

11:39.247 --> 11:41.624
- One day.
- Why'd you tell her that?

11:42.500 --> 11:44.377
Well anyway

11:45.002 --> 11:47.505
DUH-HUH!

11:47.588 --> 11:48.423
All that to say, I have no idea what

11:48.506 --> 11:49.340
She always acts cool and aloof.

11:49.424 --> 11:51.217
She's thinking, to be honest.

11:51.300 --> 11:52.927
She's not a bad person, I think.

11:53.010 --> 11:54.470
Probably. Maybe.

11:55.304 --> 11:56.889
That's what Yuki said.

11:57.890 --> 12:01.602
But I still have no idea how much or what
she actually knows about me.

12:01.686 --> 12:06.107
I hate the fact someone might know things
about me I don't want anyone to know.

12:06.190 --> 12:09.235
Just that thought makes me me so
incredibly uncomfortable.

12:09.986 --> 12:10.862
Please.

12:11.529 --> 12:13.906
I hope I don't have to see much of
her anymore.

12:32.258 --> 12:35.178
Well duh... We live in the same
neighborhood so of course we could run

12:35.261 --> 12:37.138
into each other on the way to school.

12:38.014 --> 12:38.848
So do-

12:38.931 --> 12:42.477
Do first years not participate in the
soccer club's morning practice or

12:42.560 --> 12:45.021
- something?
- There's no practice this morning.

12:45.980 --> 12:47.231
Oh... I see.

12:48.941 --> 12:50.359
SILENCE

12:50.443 --> 12:51.277
This is awkward.

12:52.236 --> 12:53.196
In moments like this

12:53.279 --> 12:56.282
the older one is supposed to start the
conversation, right?

12:56.365 --> 12:58.159
But what should I talk about?

12:59.827 --> 13:01.078
What do we have in common?

13:01.162 --> 13:01.996
Anything?

13:02.079 --> 13:04.582
I really don't wanna talk about
junior high school.

13:04.665 --> 13:05.750
Maybe high school?

13:05.833 --> 13:07.794
Ugh who wants to talk about school?

13:09.504 --> 13:12.006
What should I do? I'm so bad at talking.

13:16.552 --> 13:17.386
Good morning.

13:19.222 --> 13:20.139
Hey, Amamiya.

13:24.227 --> 13:25.061
What was that reaction?

13:25.144 --> 13:25.978
THUMP THUMP THUMP THUMP THUMP THUMP

13:26.062 --> 13:29.023
Thank goodness.

13:29.106 --> 13:29.941
I'll be okay now.

13:30.024 --> 13:30.858
Hi Amamiya...

13:30.942 --> 13:31.776
Huh?

13:31.859 --> 13:32.777
- Good to see you.
- Did you two come together?

13:32.860 --> 13:34.529
Ran into each other on the train.

13:37.198 --> 13:38.032
Wow!

13:38.658 --> 13:39.992
You like that song too?

13:40.076 --> 13:41.452
I play it on repeat.

13:42.328 --> 13:43.162
Wow...

13:43.246 --> 13:45.623
He's so good at keeping the conversation
going.

13:46.457 --> 13:47.291
Amamiya

13:47.875 --> 13:51.754
I'm sorry for thinking you asked way too
many questions or found it exhausting.

13:51.838 --> 13:55.383
And I'm also sorry for laughing
at you when you were totally losing it.

13:55.466 --> 13:56.551
Stare.

13:57.301 --> 13:59.136
W-What? Something on my face?

14:00.012 --> 14:00.847
No

14:00.930 --> 14:04.559
MMPH MMPH

14:04.642 --> 14:05.476
I just feel

14:05.560 --> 14:09.480
kinda bad for teasing you back when you
were freaking out during spring break.

14:09.564 --> 14:10.398
Wait, why now?

14:14.819 --> 14:16.529
- Oh I'm getting it.
- Mmm

14:16.612 --> 14:17.446
Right here.

14:17.530 --> 14:18.364
- Force field.
- C'mon.

14:18.447 --> 14:19.365
You two're close, huh?

14:19.448 --> 14:21.367
Not really. I'm being bullied by her.

14:21.868 --> 14:23.077
She's blackmailing me.

14:23.578 --> 14:24.745
Huh? Hold on a minute.

14:31.502 --> 14:32.753
Hey, good morning, Akine!

14:33.379 --> 14:34.213
Momoka.

14:34.297 --> 14:36.924
I happened to see you and just ran
right over here.

14:37.008 --> 14:38.050
Wow

14:38.134 --> 14:39.969
she looks like a doll or something.

14:40.052 --> 14:41.178
Oh hi, Amamiya.

14:41.679 --> 14:42.930
Good morning to you too.

14:43.764 --> 14:44.599
Kuriki, right?

14:45.349 --> 14:47.560
You came to check out our club the
other day.

14:47.643 --> 14:49.520
Oh my goodness, you remember me?

14:50.396 --> 14:53.399
I ended up ultimately choosing not
to join a club after all

14:53.482 --> 14:55.192
so I haven't been back since.

14:55.693 --> 14:57.653
Aha, don't even worry about it.

14:57.737 --> 14:59.113
Plus, Atagawa's joining us.

14:59.864 --> 15:01.198
Oh I'm not that great-

15:01.282 --> 15:03.492
Akine seems like she'd be really
good at it.

15:04.035 --> 15:05.786
- It's like she glows.
- Hm?

15:06.787 --> 15:07.622
Oh.

15:09.874 --> 15:11.292
Oh... I get it.

15:12.084 --> 15:13.544
I think I'm not welcome here.

15:13.628 --> 15:14.670
That's it.

15:15.588 --> 15:17.465
I guess I'll just head to class then.

15:21.427 --> 15:22.261
What is he-

15:25.723 --> 15:26.807
Well then, Amamiya

15:26.891 --> 15:28.017
See you around.

15:28.643 --> 15:30.019
See you at the cheer squad.

15:34.941 --> 15:36.901
- What was that?
- I dunno...

15:36.984 --> 15:40.071
just thought you might be trying to
quietly float away again.

15:42.531 --> 15:44.492
- You got me.
- It was obvious.

15:47.620 --> 15:48.663
WHOOSH WHOOSH

15:48.746 --> 15:52.333
- I feel like a dog being taken for a walk.
- Wanna run in the park?

15:52.416 --> 15:53.250
What is this?

15:53.334 --> 15:54.210
PONTA

15:54.293 --> 15:55.127
No thank you.

15:57.004 --> 15:58.047
I'm over the moon.

15:58.130 --> 16:00.508
I didn't think Amamiya would remember me!

16:01.425 --> 16:04.053
Momoka. You've only met this guy one time.

16:04.637 --> 16:06.347
Correction: I met him two times!

16:07.014 --> 16:07.848
Okay.

16:09.058 --> 16:10.601
Hey Akine...

16:11.560 --> 16:12.853
Do you think that Amamiya

16:12.937 --> 16:14.271
might have a girlfriend?

16:16.148 --> 16:17.858
CHATTER CHATTER

16:18.359 --> 16:20.152
Hmm... I don't know.

16:20.945 --> 16:22.154
Can you find out for me?

16:26.575 --> 16:28.703
So how's your new class?

16:31.747 --> 16:35.584
You keep staring at me with this weird
grin and it's making me uncomfortable.

16:35.668 --> 16:37.420
IRREGULARLY HELD DINNER MEETING

16:37.503 --> 16:40.548
Oh what a delight. I'm ever so
happy to see you happy.

16:41.298 --> 16:43.217
Yeah whatever that is, knock it off.

16:45.386 --> 16:48.264
I didn't think I'd ever be fussing over
people this much.

16:48.889 --> 16:50.725
So, anything going on with you?

16:50.808 --> 16:51.851
Huh?

16:52.351 --> 16:53.185
No. Nothing.

16:53.269 --> 16:54.103
HMPH

16:54.729 --> 16:55.771
Okay, sorry I asked.

16:56.522 --> 16:58.733
To be honest with you, back in
junior high

16:58.816 --> 17:00.735
I only dated this one guy.

17:02.069 --> 17:04.321
I tried to get to know him little by
little.

17:05.573 --> 17:09.035
I dated him, thinking I'd eventually fall
in love with him over time.

17:09.910 --> 17:11.328
But that didn't go too well.

17:12.621 --> 17:13.456
I realized

17:13.539 --> 17:16.417
you can't fall in love by forcing
yourself to like someone.

17:16.500 --> 17:17.334
It won't work.

17:17.418 --> 17:18.252
IMPURE MOTIVE

17:19.545 --> 17:21.797
And that wasn't the only reason
I dated him.

17:21.881 --> 17:24.008
I'M SURE

17:24.091 --> 17:26.677
- C'mon don't ask me that.
- But you're different aren't you?

17:26.761 --> 17:29.096
There's a lot of different kinds of
love in the world.

17:29.180 --> 17:30.264
DIFFERENT KINDS

17:30.347 --> 17:32.183
If the type or the sizes don't match

17:32.850 --> 17:34.810
one of the people is going to struggle.

17:35.436 --> 17:37.438
It's not enough to just be liked

17:37.521 --> 17:38.898
or to give love one-sidedly

17:38.981 --> 17:39.982
I'M THE ONLY ONE STRUGGLING

17:40.066 --> 17:40.900
Love is hard.

17:41.650 --> 17:42.985
I feel like I'm still so far

17:43.069 --> 17:44.528
from understanding it.

17:44.612 --> 17:46.238
CREEP CREEP

17:46.322 --> 17:48.491
CURRENT SITUATION

17:48.574 --> 17:50.910
- Don't tell me that. Oh nooo
- Oh.

17:51.577 --> 17:52.411
Get outta here!

17:55.748 --> 17:56.749
I'm sorry.

18:01.587 --> 18:03.881
- I didn't mean it like that.
- How about gyoza?

18:03.964 --> 18:07.384
- No, that stuff makes your breath stink.
- Oh. They're from our school.

18:07.468 --> 18:08.469
Mm?

18:08.552 --> 18:10.387
HURRIEDLY

18:12.723 --> 18:13.599
Upperclassmen.

18:13.682 --> 18:14.767
This is awkward.

18:15.351 --> 18:17.436
A gyoza date's kinda low-key cool, though.

18:17.520 --> 18:18.979
Wait, that girl...

18:23.692 --> 18:25.027
Sorry if my breath stinks.

18:25.111 --> 18:27.279
My breath smells the same, so I
can't tell.

18:35.371 --> 18:36.205
Oh.

18:41.043 --> 18:41.961
Good morning.

18:43.295 --> 18:44.213
You... scared me.

18:44.713 --> 18:47.049
Reading a book while walking?
That's not safe.

18:48.259 --> 18:50.052
- Tch.
- Don't "tch" me.

18:51.178 --> 18:52.304
What were you reading?

18:53.681 --> 18:54.515
Um, I-

18:55.349 --> 18:56.892
What's that? It looks boring.

18:56.976 --> 18:59.019
THE NERVOUSNESS OF TALKING ABOUT
SOMETHING I LIKE Oh

18:59.103 --> 18:59.937
Huh?

19:00.604 --> 19:02.857
I haven't read it, but I did watch the
movie.

19:03.357 --> 19:04.400
It was interesting.

19:05.067 --> 19:05.943
SOFTEN

19:06.986 --> 19:10.072
Another movie based on their books will
be streaming this week.

19:10.156 --> 19:12.408
Oh I watched that in the theater.

19:12.908 --> 19:14.702
I really liked the original novel so

19:14.785 --> 19:18.122
of course I was super excited to see it
adapted for the screen.

19:18.205 --> 19:20.583
Oh... Well, she's in a good mood.

19:21.208 --> 19:23.794
Well if you thought it was good,
I'll check it out.

19:25.421 --> 19:26.338
She looks happy.

19:29.842 --> 19:30.801
She's so cute.

19:31.594 --> 19:32.428
Oh

19:32.511 --> 19:34.847
But I'm sorry in advance if you end up
not liking it.

19:34.930 --> 19:36.056
Woah, why so negative?

19:36.140 --> 19:37.433
I MAY HAVE SET THE BAR TOO HIGH

19:37.516 --> 19:38.350
It'll be fine.

19:45.232 --> 19:46.483
Oh, so we meet again!

19:46.567 --> 19:47.735
Morning, Amamiya!

19:48.485 --> 19:50.446
Oh, Kuriki. Good morning.

19:50.529 --> 19:53.574
Hey, are you going to the cheer squad's
morning practice too?

19:53.657 --> 19:55.409
Mm-mm. I have club practice.

19:56.327 --> 19:57.912
But you'll be there, right Koyun?

19:57.995 --> 19:58.954
Oh.

19:59.038 --> 19:59.872
Yeah.

20:00.539 --> 20:01.874
He calls her... Koyun?

20:04.335 --> 20:05.169
Hello.

20:06.503 --> 20:08.380
THE CONVERSATION ISN'T GOING ANYWHERE

20:10.507 --> 20:11.550
Madam Koyun?

20:12.051 --> 20:13.427
What a weird nickname.

20:13.510 --> 20:14.887
We met yesterday, right?

20:15.512 --> 20:17.014
In front of the restaurant.

20:17.097 --> 20:18.807
Uh Right.

20:18.891 --> 20:20.768
I didn't think she recognized me.

20:21.560 --> 20:23.646
That really tall guy I saw you out with

20:23.729 --> 20:24.813
Is he your boyfriend?

20:26.523 --> 20:28.150
What- No- He's just a friend!

20:28.234 --> 20:29.193
Oh

20:29.276 --> 20:32.613
You guys looked so good together that I
thought you were a couple.

20:33.405 --> 20:36.283
Though I don't remember what he
looked like to be honest.

20:36.367 --> 20:37.368
No way.

20:37.451 --> 20:39.578
Is that what we look like to other
people?

20:39.662 --> 20:41.664
This misunderstanding's a problem.

20:41.747 --> 20:42.706
Yay!

20:43.582 --> 20:44.416
Um...

20:44.500 --> 20:46.335
we're really not like that, okay?

20:46.418 --> 20:48.629
We're just good friends. That's all
we are.

20:48.712 --> 20:50.798
Oh gotcha. Well that's still really nice.

20:51.298 --> 20:52.299
So then

20:52.383 --> 20:54.218
Do you guys go out to eat together?

20:54.301 --> 20:55.511
Just the two of you?

20:56.011 --> 20:57.054
Alone?

20:59.682 --> 21:00.724
Just the two of us?

21:00.808 --> 21:02.685
- No, not really.
- Right.

21:03.185 --> 21:04.186
Want to?

21:04.270 --> 21:05.479
Stop messing around.

21:06.939 --> 21:08.482
I was being dead serious.

21:12.111 --> 21:15.114
I'm not comfortable asking other
people about their private lives.

21:15.197 --> 21:16.448
Ask him yourself.

21:16.991 --> 21:19.118
Woah, that's kinda harsh, don't you
think?

21:21.078 --> 21:23.122
Is it cause your girlfriend would get
jealous?

21:23.205 --> 21:25.291
Huh? No, I don't have a girlfriend.

21:25.374 --> 21:26.542
Are you serious?

21:26.625 --> 21:29.878
That's weird. You seem like you'd
be really popular with girls.

21:29.962 --> 21:30.963
Right, Madame Koyun?

21:31.839 --> 21:32.673
Huh? Oh

21:32.756 --> 21:34.133
CONVERSATION FROM A WHILE BACK

21:34.216 --> 21:37.469
I guess so.
You DO seem like you've dated a lot.

21:39.346 --> 21:41.015
Th-That's not even remotely true!

21:42.266 --> 21:44.810
Denying it like that just makes it more
suspicious.

21:44.893 --> 21:45.728
Huh?

21:46.395 --> 21:48.397
- Yeah, it does.
- Hey, now...

21:49.189 --> 21:50.774
No no no, wait, come on.

21:51.525 --> 21:53.444
Is that the impression you have of me?

21:59.158 --> 22:00.743
The reason he's trying so hard

22:00.826 --> 22:01.785
to deny it...

23:34.002 --> 23:36.171
GRADE 1 CLASS 1

23:39.591 --> 23:40.509
Guess what, Akine?

23:41.093 --> 23:43.303
PERKING UP

23:43.387 --> 23:44.221
I just found out Amamiya doesn't have a

23:44.304 --> 23:45.139
So why waste your time telling me?

23:45.222 --> 23:45.806
Girlfriend!

23:47.641 --> 23:49.935
Go on then... this might be your chance.

23:52.312 --> 23:53.272
I know, right?
